"4398","Salmon Dip","Chilling time not included in preparation time.","4.2","1.0","10","5","1 (15   ounce) can   salmon, drained and flaked | 2 tablespoons    onions, grated | 1 tablespoon    lemon juice | 1 (8   ounce) package   cream cheese, softened | 1 teaspoon    liquid smoke | 1 cup    nuts, chopped | 1 cup    fresh parsley, chopped","Mix first five ingredients together and refrigerate for several hours. | Form into a log shape, then roll in a mixture of nuts and parsley.","","Refrigerator"
