"8821","Bronx","a Prohibition drink that disquises the alcohol from the police. Use a blood orange for a Bloody Bronx","5.0","1.0","5","1","1 1⁄2 ounces    gin | 1⁄2 ounce    dry vermouth | 1⁄2 ounce    sweet vermouth | 1⁄2 ounce    orange juice | 1⁄2 ounce    lemon juice (optional)","Shake with ice and strain into a wine glass, or on the rocks.","","Beverages"
"8822","Big Apple","beautiful. fun. a cup you can eat when you are done.","5.0","1.0","30","1","1 apple | 3 ounces    brandy | 2 ounces    orange juice | 1 ounce    lemon juice","Cut a hole in the top of the apple and use a melon baller to scoop out the core and more to make room for the drink. | Place the apple shell in the freezer for 15 minutes. | Mix the rest of the ingredients with the removed apple pulp in a blender. | Strain into the apple shell and serve with a straw.","","Beverages"
