"10247","Sweet & Sour Meatballs","Great for that informal party.","4.0","40.0","75","1","2 lbs    ground beef | 3⁄4 cup    evaporated milk | 2 (1 1/4  ounce) packages   onion soup mix | 2 tablespoons    Worcestershire sauce | 2 cups    catsup | 1 cup    brown sugar","Preheat oven to 400°F. | Mix together ground beef, milk, onion soup and Worcestershire sauce. | Roll into tiny meatballs and place on a cookie sheet. | Bake in preheated oven for about 20 minutes. | Remove from oven and drain. | Place meat balls in a crock pot. | Sauce-----------. | Mix together the catsup and brown sugar and pour over the meatballs. | Heat until hot and serve.","https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/v1/img/recipes/10/24/7/piclb9jMD.jpg","Meat"
