"10826","Monica's Peanut Butter Bread","My son loves peanut butter and this is delicious for breakfast and dessert.","0.0","1.0","58","0","2 cups    all-purpose flour | 1⁄3 cup    sugar | 2 teaspoons    baking powder | 1 teaspoon    salt | 1 egg | 1 cup    milk | 3⁄4 cup    peanut butter","Combine the first four ingredients in a large mixing bowl. | Add egg, milk and peanut butter. | Stir the mixture until the ingredients are combined. | Spoon into a greased 8 in x 4 in x 2 in loaf pan. | Bake in a 350F degrees  for 50-60 minutes or until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean. | Cool for 10-15 minutes in the pan before moving to a wire rack.","","Breads"
