"10963","Chunky Chocolate and Oat Cookies","yuuuuuummmm!","5.0","20.0","30","2","250 g    butter | 3 tablespoons    sweetened condensed milk | 3⁄4 cup    sugar | 1 1⁄2 cups    flour | 1 1⁄2 cups    rolled oats | 1 teaspoon    baking powder | 250 g    chocolate, roughly chopped","Beat butter, condensed milk and sugar together until light and creamy. | Add flour, oats, baking powder and chocolate chunks. | Flatten spoonfuls of mixture on to a well greased oven tray and bake for 15-20 minutes at 180°C or until golden brown. | Cool on a wire rack and store in an airtight container.","","Drop Cookies"
