"38773","Pea Salad","","4.89","6.0","15","9","1 bag    frozen peas (thawed) | 1 cup    Miracle Whip | 1⁄4 cup    sugar | 1 cup   shredded cheese | 1 jar    bacon bits","Combine peas, cheese and bacon bits in medium tupperware container. | In small bowl mix Miracle whip and Sugar. | Pour over and mix in Pea mix. | Chill several hours or overnite.","","< 15 Mins"
